@startuml Monthly Report Generation - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Membuat Laporan Bulanan (Accounting)

actor "Accounting" as Accounting
participant "Filament UI" as UI
participant "Report\nPage" as Page
participant "Report\nGenerator" as Generator
participant "Database" as DB

== Akses Laporan ==
Accounting -> UI: Akses menu Laporan
activate UI
UI -> Page: Show report page
activate Page
Page --> UI: Report options
deactivate Page
UI --> Accounting: Tampilkan pilihan jenis laporan
deactivate UI

Accounting -> UI: Pilih periode (bulan/tahun)
activate UI
UI --> Accounting: Form filter periode
deactivate UI

== Laporan Purchase Order ==
Accounting -> UI: Pilih "Laporan Purchase Order"
activate UI
UI -> Page: Request PO report
activate Page
Page -> Generator: Generate PO report\n(month, year)
activate Generator

note right of Generator
    - Query PO data by period
    - Calculate statistics
    - Generate charts
end note

Generator -> DB: Query PO data
activate DB
DB --> Generator: PO data
deactivate DB

Generator -> Generator: Calculate metrics:\n- Total per status\n- Top suppliers\n- Trend analysis

Generator --> Page: Report data + charts
deactivate Generator
Page --> UI: Render report
deactivate Page
UI --> Accounting: Tampilkan laporan PO
deactivate UI

== Laporan Penerimaan Barang ==
Accounting -> UI: Pilih "Laporan Penerimaan Barang"
activate UI
UI -> Page: Request GR report
activate Page
Page -> Generator: Generate GR report\n(month, year)
activate Generator

note right of Generator
    - Query GR data
    - Calculate acceptance rate
    - Supplier performance
end note

Generator -> DB: Query GR data
activate DB
DB --> Generator: GR data
deactivate DB

Generator -> Generator: Calculate metrics:\n- Acceptance rate\n- Supplier performance\n- Rejection analysis

Generator --> Page: Report data + charts
deactivate Generator
Page --> UI: Render report
deactivate Page
UI --> Accounting: Tampilkan laporan GR
deactivate UI

== Laporan Stok Produk ==
Accounting -> UI: Pilih "Laporan Stok Produk"
activate UI
UI -> Page: Request stock report
activate Page
Page -> Generator: Generate stock report
activate Generator

note right of Generator
    - Query product data
    - Calculate stock levels
    - Identify reorder needs
end note

Generator -> DB: Query product & stock data
activate DB
DB --> Generator: Product data
deactivate DB

Generator -> Generator: Calculate:\n- Low/out stock products\n- Projected stock\n- Reorder suggestions

Generator --> Page: Report data + charts
deactivate Generator
Page --> UI: Render report
deactivate Page
UI --> Accounting: Tampilkan laporan Stok
deactivate UI

== Laporan Keuangan ==
Accounting -> UI: Pilih "Laporan Keuangan"
activate UI
UI -> Page: Request financial report
activate Page
Page -> Generator: Generate financial report\n(month, year)
activate Generator

note right of Generator
    - Query PO financial data
    - Calculate spending
    - Outstanding amounts
end note

Generator -> DB: Query financial data
activate DB
DB --> Generator: PO & spending data
deactivate DB

Generator -> Generator: Calculate:\n- Total spending\n- Outstanding amounts\n- Spending trends

Generator --> Page: Report data + charts
deactivate Generator
Page --> UI: Render report
deactivate Page
UI --> Accounting: Tampilkan laporan Keuangan
deactivate UI

== Export Laporan ==
Accounting -> UI: Klik "Export"
activate UI
UI --> Accounting: Pilihan format (PDF/Excel/CSV)
deactivate UI

Accounting -> UI: Pilih format export
activate UI
UI -> Page: Request export
activate Page
Page -> Generator: Generate file\n(format)
activate Generator

alt Format PDF
    Generator -> Generator: Generate PDF
else Format Excel
    Generator -> Generator: Generate Excel
else Format CSV
    Generator -> Generator: Generate CSV
end

Generator --> Page: File download
deactivate Generator
Page --> UI: Download response
deactivate Page
UI --> Accounting: Download laporan
deactivate UI

@enduml
